":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、そして、海外のBuddiesの皆さんからは嬉しいサプライズがありました✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと、ニューヨークのタイムズスクエアにメンバー全員分のかっこいい映像や、メッセージなどを流して下さったのです、、！😭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんに教えて頂き、動画も全て拝見させて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄くびっくりして一瞬時が止まりました、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私なりに色々調べながら書いたので間違っているところもあるかも知れませんが、少しでも感謝の気持ちが伝わればいいなと思っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hi, Buddies in all over the world!\nI was so surprised to see the video of Times Square the other day！\nThere were all the introductions for each of us!\nIt made me so happy and I have received such a big love！\nThank you very very much for the sweetest present:)\nI really want to see you and give a good performance soon!\nWe will definitely see you so please wait for a little longer.."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"I LOVE YOU BUDDIES❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界中のBuddiesの皆さん本当にありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202112/mob8Ey9qY.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2年目もよろしくお願いします‼️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"typ